     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">I have a shiny app which works fine when running in my computer. I have saved the image files in a folder named </span><code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(36,39,41)\">www</code><span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"> inside the Shiny app directory following the guide lines from </span><a href=\"https://shiny.rstudio.com/tutorial/lesson2/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\" style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgb(0,89,153);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://shiny.rstudio.com/tutorial/lesson2/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361115113000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1k0-5RAfx9C7FJ3F39aO_9\">https://shiny.rstudio.com/tutorial/lesson2/</a><span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">. I am now trying to host this app in a website and I am following the guidelines from </span><a href=\"http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/index.html\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\" style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgb(0,89,153);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361115113000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3INMZql-82UKfC-MRRcAKV\">http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/index.html</a><span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">. It works, the website link is given below </span><a href=\"https://washoffmodelling.shinyapps.io/washoff-app/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\" style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgb(0,89,153);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://washoffmodelling.shinyapps.io/washoff-app/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361115113000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0jnTx9VBvotrjSD2otAAms\">https://washoffmodelling.shinyapps.io/washoff-app/</a><span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">. But as you can see the image is not displayed. I googled the problem and the closest solution I can found is </span><a href=\"https://github.com/rstudio/rmarkdown/issues/504\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\" style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgb(0,89,153);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rstudio/rmarkdown/issues/504&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792361115113000&amp;usg=AOvVaw27pG1hWHPu_CmzIq3KNyzH\">this answer</a><span style=\"color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px\">. But it is about ioslides, does not actually solve my problem. Can somebody help me to sort out this problem? Thanks in advance.</span><br></div>"
